...Did she?%K%P
…她分析过了么？%K%P
I feel like all she's been doing these past few days was\npartying, tutoring Mitoko, and quarreling with me.%K%P
我怎么感觉这几天她在宴会和家庭教师的事上，\n和我不住地争吵，从早到晚就没停过啊。%K%P
