在几分钟之前，对于她的印象，\n还只是『女性』『年轻』『大学生』等等轻蔑印象的他们，\n现今全都哑口无言。%K%P
That is just how effective her preemptive strike was.\n...Although I felt like the source of her information\nmight have been a little questionable.%K%P
