Why was she here?%K%P
为什么你会在这儿？%K%P
What about university? Whose idea was this? Her own?%K%P
大学呢？\n这是谁的安排？\n还是说出于自己的意志？%K%P
Did she have any experience in this...? Well, obviously\nshe wouldn't.%K%P
培养独立董事的经验…呃，不可能的吧。%K%P
