\d\dSo,\d what?\d%K%P
「那，什么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, uh... I was just wondering why you were here.\d%K%P
「不，我说…\n你为什么也来这里了？」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDid the hot water fry your brain?!\d%K%P
「泡晕头了吗！？」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dThis public bathhouse is quite nice. Perhaps because you\nare here as well, Mr. Yoshimura.\d%K%P
「因为公共浴池是个好地方。\n而且，这也是和芳村先生…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTwo-way communication is one of the most important\npillars of society, I would say!\d%K%P
「双向沟通，\n对于社会生活可是非常重要的！」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dWell, leaving those sorts of jokes aside...\d%K%P
「嘛，只是开个玩笑」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou -were- joking, weren't you? You were just trying to\nget a laugh out of me, right?\d%K%P
「真的是玩笑吗？\n你只是在逗我吗？」%K%P
It wasn't particularly effective, but provided it was no\nmore than a joke, I was safe. Probably.%K%P
虽然完全没有戳中笑点，\n但要是玩笑我也就放心了…肯定是这样…%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dIt's about Milady.\d%K%P
「关于大小姐的事」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
As Sasaki's voice returned to normal, I too drew slightly\ncloser to him.%K%P
佐佐木先生的声音突然低沉下去，\n同时我也稍微缩短了和他保持的安全距离。%K%P
He himself has presented me with the opportunity I was\nlooking for -- I couldn't waste this chance now.%K%P
我一直以来虎视眈眈的机会，\n佐佐木先生居然自己送上门来了。\n这可不能放过。%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dI am sorry for putting you into this situation. And allow\nme to apologize in Milady's place.\d%K%P
「这回的事…\n真是麻烦您了。\n我替大小姐，向您表示万分歉意」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, it's most definitely true that she found me a new\nplace to work. For that, I cannot thank her enough.\d%K%P
「没…她帮助我找到工作，确实帮了我的忙。\n对于这一点，我还要万分感谢她呢」%K%P
Not to mention, she presented me with an opportunity to\nreclaim my honor at a company I'd already been fired from.%K%P
而且，在曾经被当做叛徒而扫地出门的公司里，\n我得到了挽回名誉的机会。%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dThat is just a result. It was merely another method for\nMilady to achieve her goal.\d%K%P
「结果只是一个副产品。\n对于大小姐来说，这是为了达成目的，而采取的手段」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI wonder why she hates me so much...?\d%K%P
「为什么她…\n会那么讨厌我呢？」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dHate, you say? Far from it. If anything, I believe she\nappreciates you a great deal.\d%K%P
「讨厌？没那回事的。\n硬要说的话，她对您应该是很中意的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d.........Excuse me?\d%K%P
「………什么？」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dIn the five years that I have served her, you are the\nfirst man to make Milady tremble in genuine anger to the\npoint that she loses track of the conversation.\d%K%P
「今年是我在她手下工作的第五个年头，\n大小姐和男人见面后，对其反复提起，\n表露出怒气的，你可是第一个」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Is that your idea of appreciation?\d%K%P
「…这就意味着她中意我么？」%K%P
I felt like there might've been an issue with our\ncommunication after all.%K%P
果然双方的沟通，\n有些欠缺吧？%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dThe opposite of affection is apathy. As for hostility,\nit's a homogeneous emotion. I read about that once from\nthe book of a wise man.\d%K%P
「好意的对立面，是漠不关心，\n厌恶也与之类似，\n{小本子:傲娇大全}书上是这么说的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf that was really the case, then brides and mothers-in-\nlaw all across the nation would be \djust too shy to admit\nthey love each other.\d\d%K%P
「照这么说，全国的儿媳妇和婆婆，\n都是『彼此喜欢对方却不坦率』的关系，\n是这样吗？」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dWould you still be skeptical if I told you that for the\npast fifteen weeks, you've been the man Milady kept\ntalking about the most, overtaking even her own father?\d%K%P
「根据大小姐乘车时的男性话题人物排行榜，\n您可是超越了泽嶋老爷，连续１５周排在第一位了啊？」\n※译注：NETA《青空下的约定》里三村茜的台词。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um... Wh-What about you, Mr. Sasaki? You've served her\nfor many years, haven't you?\d%K%P
「那、那啥………\n再、再说，佐佐木先生你才是，\n不是在她身边侍奉了好几年吗」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dI am not attracted to women.\d%K%P
「我是不会爱上女性的」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\d...That was a jest, though. I do have a wife and child in\nNagoya.\d%K%P
「…开个玩笑。\n我有老婆和孩子。在名古屋」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...So you live away from your family.\d%K%P
「单………\n单身赴任，是吗」%K%P
The bath water I kept disturbing was boiling my skin.%K%P
一下子倒进来的热水好烫…%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dYet in this case alone, I cannot help but think that\nMilady is making a grave mistake.\d%K%P
「有关这次的事…\n我只能认为是大小姐选错了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's...\d%K%P
「那是…」%K%P
I had to agree.%K%P
我简直不能再同意他。%K%P
I didn't know what kind of education she received as a\nSawashima child, but their choice of personnel sounded\nbeyond reckless.%K%P
我不知道身为泽嶋家小姐的她，\n一直以来接受的是怎样的教育，\n但这次的人事调动，只能用无谋来评价。%K%P
The pressure. The backlash from Michima itself. And the\nunavoidable glare of publicity once this information got\nout to the public eye.%K%P
担在身上的重任，道浜商事方面的抵触，\n以及整个社会舆论得知这个事实后的议论纷纷，\n不由得引起人们兴趣与好奇的目光。%K%P
And if I had to say whether she had the ability to handle\nall that... Unfortunately, she did not.%K%P
她到底有没有排除一切的魄力呢？\n很遗憾，答案是否定的。%K%P
As someone who had lived through countless failures in\nthis society, I felt certain of my assessment.%K%P
这个判断一定没错。\n…毕竟这是作为社会败者的我所保证的。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIn any case, why is she so obsessed with Mitoko, anyway?\d%K%P
「那她为什么，\n要那么执着于美都子呢？」%K%P
If her motive wasn't hatred for me, then that was about\nthe only reason I could come up with.%K%P
既然她的动机，不是出于对我的憎恨，\n那剩下的可能性只有一个了。%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dHonestly, I do not know myself. However...\d%K%P
「说真的，我也很不能理解…可是」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHowever... what?\d%K%P
「可是…什么？」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dI have heard that exact same question fall from Milady's\nlips as well.\d%K%P
「大小姐也说过完全相同的话」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\d\dWhy is that man so obsessed with Toko?\d\d%K%P
「『为什么那个男人，要那么执着于小都子呢？』」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Why was I obsessed with Mitoko...?%K%P
我执着于美都子的理由…？%K%P
Because she was the daughter of my benefactor? Or because\nshe was my benefactor herself?%K%P
因为她是恩人的女儿吗？\n因为是恩人？%K%P
Because she was all on her own? Because she became my\nfriend?%K%P
因为她孤身一人？\n因为成为了她的朋友？%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dPerhaps... you are the person closest to Milady's heart.\d%K%P
「说不定…\n你和大小姐是最心灵相通的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat couldn't possibly...\d%K%P
「那种可能…」%K%P
The reason I couldn't push Mitoko out of my mind... was\nsimply because she was Mitoko. That's it.%K%P
………正因为，她是美都子啊。%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dMr. Yoshimura... I do hope I can trust you with Milady.\d%K%P
「芳村先生…\n大小姐还要您多多关照了」%K%P
Then why did she obsess over her?%K%P
那她执着的理由是？%K%P
Because she was her Toko...?%K%P
正因为，她是小都子吗？%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dTo be honest, now that Milady has joined the world of\nbusiness for real, I fear I lack the capability to\nthoroughly support her on my own.\d%K%P
「不瞒您说，大小姐加入实业界之后，\n我就帮不了她了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMr. Sasaki...\d%K%P
「佐佐木先生…」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dIt is not my place to talk, but... I shall be completely\nhonest for a moment here: Milady is still ignorant of and\ngreatly underestimates the hurdles of the real world.\d%K%P
「虽然我没有资格这么说，\n但上次那事真的很抱歉…\n大小姐把社会看得太简单了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I imagine she does.\d%K%P
「…说的是呢」%K%P
Her naive kindness towards Mitoko, as well as her nigh-\nchildish animosity towards me.%K%P
对美都子怀着孩子气的善意。\n对我怀着孩子气的恶意。%K%P
Her genuine willingness to be charitable, most likely\nstemming from her naturally amiable disposition.%K%P
这只是从小就接受着善意的教育，\n培养出来的一种毫无怨言的奉献者精神。%K%P
She lacked a great many things while displaying an\noverabundance of features that made her unfit to run a\nprofitable business the Sawashima way.%K%P
『泽嶋』她…\n现在要是染指一切以利益为基准的企业活动，\n身上不够的东西和多余的东西比比皆是。%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dShe needs help from you -- the man who single-handedly\nsaved Kamata.\d%K%P
「您…\n拯救镰田破产危机于水火之中的芳村理，您的力量是必要的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, that's a misunderstanding...\d%K%P
「不，我想您还是有重大误解…」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dI do hope you will give some thought to this. Now,\nthen...\d%K%P
「请您再慎重考虑一下。\n…告辞」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMr. Sasaki...\d%K%P
「佐佐木先生…」%K%P
He emerged from the water to reveal muscles that put the\nStatue of David to shame. He hid it well under that black\nsuit.%K%P
佐佐木先生离开了浴池，\n在他平时的黑衣下面，难以想象，\n居然是令人不禁心驰神往的肌肉…%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dAh, by the way...\d%K%P
「啊啊，还有啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dY-Yes?\d%K%P
「什、什么？」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dWhat I said about having a wife and child was also a jest\non my part. It was simply intended to set you at ease.\d%K%P
「老婆和孩子那个是开玩笑。\n我是为了让您放松一下心情」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCover that up, now!\d%K%P
「请你把前面遮好！」%K%P
The disturbed water of the bath boilllled my flesh!%K%P
一、一下子倒进来的热水好烫～烫烫烫烫～！%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSorry to bother you with this, but could you align it\nwith the corner?\d%K%P
