%LCMale Clerk
%LC男性职员
\d...Are you sure you're okay with this?\d%K%P
「…真的合适吗？这样」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOf course. We were the ones who barged into your office\nwith hardly any notice. I'm glad there was any space for\nus at all.\d%K%P
「那当然了。\n然后从这里插进去。\n还有空余的地方，真是太幸运了」%K%P
%LCOffice Lady
%LC女性事务员
\dBut you didn't need to go all the way to...\d%K%P
「可是，特意弄成这样…」%K%P
