%LC理
\dAh, good morning.\d%K%P
「啊，您早上～好」%K%P
%LCMale Clerk
%LC男性职员
\dGood morning.\d%K%P
「您早上好」%K%P
%LCOffice Lady
%LC女性事务员
\dGood morning.\d%K%P
「您早上好」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThis is anything but a good morning!\d%K%P
「早上好个毛线啊！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI can see you're already living on an executive's\ntimetable.\d%K%P
