A glance at the clock revealed it to be almost eleven in\nthe morning -- it had been three hours since I myself\narrived at the office.%K%P
我看了看钟表，差不多１１点钟了。\n离我开始工作，已经过了３个小时。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWhat did you do with my desk?! Are you trying to pick a\nfight with me or something?\d%K%P
