「它就在您的面前啊」%K%P
The office boasted a hundred or so identical desks, each a\npinnacle of craftsmanship, prioritizing sheer\nfunctionality over aesthetics.%K%P
这个办公室里，大概有１００张相同的桌子。\n丰富的功能，毫无个性，真是和价格相衬的极品。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWhat happened to the desk from my executive room? Or\nrather, why on earth is that room completely empty now?!\d%K%P
