%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, I took care of that myself. I felt we could carry a\nconference table in there at one point, to turn the place\ninto a project room of sorts.\d%K%P
「啊啊，那个稍后收拾一下吧。\n以后，那个房间放上会议桌，\n作为项目开发室开放吧」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dBut why?!\d%K%P
「为什么！？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA small company like ours cannot afford to waste such a\ngood room on someone merely fooling around.\d%K%P
