%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAh...?!\d%K%P
「啊…！？」%K%P
Her face turned blue as she skimmed through the hand-\nwritten approval document that I dangled in front of her\neyes.%K%P
我拿出字迹龙飞凤舞的决定书给她看了看，\n她的脸，变得青一阵红一阵。%K%P
I see, so she at least remembered the overall appearance\nof the paper.%K%P
是么…她还记得书面条款啊。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI'll want to glance over the report for the Sawashima\nHeadquarters first thing tomorrow morning, so make sure to\nprepare it today. ...And do it on your own this time,\nwithout outside help.\d%K%P
「从现在开始，去整理下周要上交泽嶋总公司的报告资料，\n明天上午我要过目。\n…这次，你不许调动其他员工，自己一个人完成吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI believe the soonest I can prepare that is around...\n3AM.\d%K%P
「我想，最快到凌晨３点钟可以完成」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫緒
\dI see. I'm glad to hear you can make it on time.\d%K%P
「哦，那真是太好了。这不是能赶上么」%K%P
